# Review packet: 2026-10-14-log-since-filter — feature review

Base: a4bc9475395f2927bf1441eb625222a8bde6ab04

Head: efdf4f878f2deeafb8c4056fffc8ce910b5a1d84

## Commits

efdf4f8 feat: accept --since on the log-summary CLI and exit 1 on a bad date
369eedc feat: filter log summary by --since window in summarize

## Changed files

 scripts/log-summary.mjs        | 36 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++---
 tests/log-summary-cli.test.mjs | 27 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 tests/log-summary.test.mjs     | 30 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
